{"zh": "<div><section class=\"ch\" id=\"ch11\"><p class=\"lead rv\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Keep production data correct, fresh, traceable and permission-aware. Learn CDC, Lakehouse, SQL, Spark and Text-to-SQL as one delivery discipline.\" data-i18n-zh=\"让数据在生产系统中保持正确、及时、可回溯、有权限边界。理解 CDC、Lakehouse、SQL、Spark 与 Text-to-SQL 的集成决策。\">让数据在生产系统中保持正确、及时、可回溯、有权限边界。理解 CDC、Lakehouse、SQL、Spark 与 Text-to-SQL 的集成决策。</span></p><h2 class=\"sub\" id=\"data-plane\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"11.1 End-to-end data path: source events to trusted AI context\" data-i18n-zh=\"11.1 端到端数据路径：从源事件到可信 AI Context\">11.1 端到端数据路径：从源事件到可信 AI Context</span></h2>\n<p class=\"rv\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"An FDE must inspect the data plane behind RAG: source ownership, freshness, query readiness, replayability, and enforcement of tenant permissions.\" data-i18n-zh=\"FDE 不该只讨论 RAG 检索策略，还要确认：数据是谁提供的、更新有多快、何时可以查询、出了错是否能重放，以及租户权限在哪里执行。\">FDE 不该只讨论 RAG 检索策略，还要确认：数据是谁提供的、更新有多快、何时可以查询、出了错是否能重放，以及租户权限在哪里执行。</span></p>\n<pre aria-label=\"代码示例\" class=\"rv\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><code>Source DB / SaaS / events\n    ↓ CDC / batch extract\nBronze · raw append + offsets\n    ↓ schema / dedup / quarantine\nSilver · verified, versioned entities\n    ↓ contracts / temporal joins\nGold · governed customer views\n    ├── SQL, BI and workflow queries\n    ├── model features\n    └── retrieval indexing → RAG</code></pre>\n<div class=\"tsc rv\"><div aria-label=\"可横向滚动的对比表\" class=\"tw\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Boundary\" data-i18n-zh=\"边界\">边界</span></th><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Explicit contract\" data-i18n-zh=\"必须明确的约束\">必须明确的约束</span></th><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Failure\" data-i18n-zh=\"常见失败\">常见失败</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Capture\" data-i18n-zh=\"Capture\">Capture</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Sequence, offset, delete\" data-i18n-zh=\"事件序列、offset、delete\">事件序列、offset、delete</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Missed or duplicate events\" data-i18n-zh=\"漏更或重复\">漏更或重复</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Normalize\" data-i18n-zh=\"Normalize\">Normalize</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Unique key, schema, time zone\" data-i18n-zh=\"唯一键、schema、时区\">唯一键、schema、时区</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Cross-system mismatch\" data-i18n-zh=\"跨系统错配\">跨系统错配</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Consume\" data-i18n-zh=\"Consume\">Consume</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Freshness, tenancy, lineage\" data-i18n-zh=\"freshness、租户、可追溯\">freshness、租户、可追溯</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Stale or unauthorized reads\" data-i18n-zh=\"过期或越权读取\">过期或越权读取</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\n<aside class=\"co must rv\"><span class=\"co-t\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Engineering rule\" data-i18n-zh=\"工程结论\">工程结论</span></span><p><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"A fast agent with incorrect data fails faster. Correctness, freshness, and authorization are independent test dimensions.\" data-i18n-zh=\"实时 Agent + 错误的数据 = 快速出错。数据正确性、及时性与授权是不同的验证维度。\">实时 Agent + 错误的数据 = 快速出错。数据正确性、及时性与授权是不同的验证维度。</span></p></aside>\n<h2 class=\"sub\" id=\"data-etl-cdc\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"11.2 ETL / ELT / CDC: choose by data boundary\" data-i18n-zh=\"11.2 ETL / ELT / CDC：选最适合数据边界的路径\">11.2 ETL / ELT / CDC：选最适合数据边界的路径</span></h2>\n<div class=\"tsc rv\"><div aria-label=\"可横向滚动的对比表\" class=\"tw\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Mechanism\" data-i18n-zh=\"机制\">机制</span></th><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"When useful\" data-i18n-zh=\"适用情况\">适用情况</span></th><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Verify\" data-i18n-zh=\"要验证的问题\">要验证的问题</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"ETL\" data-i18n-zh=\"ETL\">ETL</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Transform before governed load\" data-i18n-zh=\"先清洗/限制敏感数据再入库\">先清洗/限制敏感数据再入库</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Can transforms be replayed?\" data-i18n-zh=\"前置逻辑能否重放？\">前置逻辑能否重放？</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"ELT\" data-i18n-zh=\"ELT\">ELT</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Governed raw landing; warehouse transforms\" data-i18n-zh=\"先安全留存原始数据，再在仓内转换\">先安全留存原始数据，再在仓内转换</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Is raw access isolated?\" data-i18n-zh=\"原始数据访问是否隔离？\">原始数据访问是否隔离？</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"CDC\" data-i18n-zh=\"CDC\">CDC</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Row-level changes and deletes\" data-i18n-zh=\"增量变更与删除传播\">增量变更与删除传播</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Snapshot, order, offset, tombstone\" data-i18n-zh=\"初始快照、顺序、offset 与 tombstone\">初始快照、顺序、offset 与 tombstone</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\n<p class=\"rv\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Batch versus streaming is driven by the consumer's visibility-lag objective, not by which architecture sounds more advanced.\" data-i18n-zh=\"Batch 与 Streaming 取决于消费者对事件可见延迟的目标，而不是“实时”是否听起来更先进。\">Batch 与 Streaming 取决于消费者对事件可见延迟的目标，而不是“实时”是否听起来更先进。</span></p>\n<h2 class=\"sub\" id=\"idempotent-pipeline\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"11.3 Idempotency: duplicated events must not duplicate effects\" data-i18n-zh=\"11.3 Idempotency：允许消息重复，不允许业务结果重复\">11.3 Idempotency：允许消息重复，不允许业务结果重复</span></h2>\n<pre aria-label=\"代码示例\" class=\"rv\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><code>event(source, event_id, entity, version, operation)\n → durable raw log\n → validate + quarantine\n → dedup(source, event_id)\n → merge if version is newer\n → atomically commit sink and checkpoint</code></pre>\n<p class=\"rv\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"At-least-once delivery is an engineering constraint. Define who owns stable idempotency keys, retries, out-of-order updates, deletes, and cross-system reconciliation.\" data-i18n-zh=\"At-least-once delivery 不是异常，而是工程约束。必须明确谁生成稳定的幂等键、何时重试、如何处理 out-of-order 更新与删除，以及跨系统写入如何补偿。\">At-least-once delivery 不是异常，而是工程约束。必须明确谁生成稳定的幂等键、何时重试、如何处理 out-of-order 更新与删除，以及跨系统写入如何补偿。</span></p>\n<h2 class=\"sub\" id=\"lakehouse-medallion\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"11.4 Lakehouse / Delta: Bronze, Silver, Gold ownership\" data-i18n-zh=\"11.4 Lakehouse / Delta：Bronze、Silver、Gold 各自负责什么\">11.4 Lakehouse / Delta：Bronze、Silver、Gold 各自负责什么</span></h2>\n<div class=\"tsc rv\"><div aria-label=\"可横向滚动的对比表\" class=\"tw\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Layer\" data-i18n-zh=\"层\">层</span></th><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Responsibility\" data-i18n-zh=\"职责\">职责</span></th><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Not a guarantee of\" data-i18n-zh=\"不可误认为\">不可误认为</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Bronze\" data-i18n-zh=\"Bronze\">Bronze</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Replayable raw data and provenance\" data-i18n-zh=\"可重放原始数据、provenance\">可重放原始数据、provenance</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Raw data is trustworthy\" data-i18n-zh=\"原始数据可信\">原始数据可信</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Silver\" data-i18n-zh=\"Silver\">Silver</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Validated, deduplicated, upserted entities\" data-i18n-zh=\"校验、去重、更新、实体标准化\">校验、去重、更新、实体标准化</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Business meaning is agreed\" data-i18n-zh=\"业务含义已经统一\">业务含义已经统一</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Gold\" data-i18n-zh=\"Gold\">Gold</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Consumer contracts and business views\" data-i18n-zh=\"业务契约与消费者视图\">业务契约与消费者视图</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Cross-system atomicity\" data-i18n-zh=\"自动解决跨系统事务\">自动解决跨系统事务</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\n<p class=\"rv\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"A Delta transaction log gives table-level snapshot and atomic-commit behavior; it does not guarantee exactly-once business effects across HTTP, queues, and other databases.\" data-i18n-zh=\"Delta transaction log 提供表层面的快照和原子提交；它本身不能保证 HTTP、消息队列、其他数据库之间的 exactly-once 业务效果。\">Delta transaction log 提供表层面的快照和原子提交；它本身不能保证 HTTP、消息队列、其他数据库之间的 exactly-once 业务效果。</span></p>\n<h2 class=\"sub\" id=\"sql-history\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"11.5 SQL windows and SCD2: preserve temporal truth\" data-i18n-zh=\"11.5 SQL Window 与 SCD2：保留时序真实性\">11.5 SQL Window 与 SCD2：保留时序真实性</span></h2>\n<pre aria-label=\"代码示例\" class=\"rv\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><code>WITH ranked AS (\n  SELECT *, ROW_NUMBER() OVER (\n    PARTITION BY tenant_id, entity_id\n    ORDER BY source_version DESC, ingested_at DESC\n  ) AS rn\n  FROM normalized_events\n)\nSELECT * FROM ranked WHERE rn = 1;</code></pre>\n<p class=\"rv\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Latest-record queries need version precedence, tie breaking and delete semantics. SCD Type 2 preserves effective-time intervals; point-in-time joins prevent training-time future leakage.\" data-i18n-zh=\"最新记录查询必须定义版本比较、并列消解、删除语义。SCD Type 2 使用 effective_from / effective_to 维护历史快照；point-in-time join 避免训练时偷看未来。\">最新记录查询必须定义版本比较、并列消解、删除语义。SCD Type 2 使用 effective_from / effective_to 维护历史快照；point-in-time join 避免训练时偷看未来。</span></p>\n<h2 class=\"sub\" id=\"spark-diagnostics\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"11.6 Spark / streaming: inspect the plan and state boundaries\" data-i18n-zh=\"11.6 Spark / Streaming：先看执行计划与状态边界\">11.6 Spark / Streaming：先看执行计划与状态边界</span></h2>\n<div class=\"tsc rv\"><div aria-label=\"可横向滚动的对比表\" class=\"tw\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Symptom\" data-i18n-zh=\"症状\">症状</span></th><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Inspect\" data-i18n-zh=\"排查入口\">排查入口</span></th><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Trade-off\" data-i18n-zh=\"权衡\">权衡</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Slow join\" data-i18n-zh=\"Join 很慢\">Join 很慢</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Explain, shuffle bytes, skew\" data-i18n-zh=\"Explain、shuffle bytes、skew\">Explain、shuffle bytes、skew</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Broadcast small tables; oversized joins risk OOM\" data-i18n-zh=\"Broadcast 对小表有效，过大会 OOM\">Broadcast 对小表有效，过大会 OOM</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Long-tail tasks\" data-i18n-zh=\"任务尾部很长\">任务尾部很长</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Task skew, spill, file count\" data-i18n-zh=\"Task skew、spill、文件数\">Task skew、spill、文件数</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"More partitions are not always better\" data-i18n-zh=\"分区数量不是越多越好\">分区数量不是越多越好</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Growing stream state\" data-i18n-zh=\"Streaming state 变大\">Streaming state 变大</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Event-time, watermark, checkpoint\" data-i18n-zh=\"Event-time、watermark、checkpoint\">Event-time、watermark、checkpoint</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Late-data policy versus completeness\" data-i18n-zh=\"迟到数据策略与完整性权衡\">迟到数据策略与完整性权衡</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\n<h2 class=\"sub\" id=\"safe-text-to-sql\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"11.7 Text-to-SQL: executable does not mean authorized\" data-i18n-zh=\"11.7 Text-to-SQL：能执行 ≠ 有权限\">11.7 Text-to-SQL：能执行 ≠ 有权限</span></h2>\n<pre aria-label=\"代码示例\" class=\"rv\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><code>User intent\n → approved semantic schema + identity\n → SQL candidate\n → parse / allowlisted operations\n → database RLS / scoped credentials\n → EXPLAIN / row and time budget\n → run / verify / return source freshness</code></pre>\n<p class=\"rv\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"An LLM-generated SELECT is not a safety guarantee. Enforce permissions in the database or a trusted service, with parsing, read-only roles, budgets and result verification as separate gates.\" data-i18n-zh=\"LLM 生成一个 SELECT 不等于安全。权限应由数据库策略或可信服务执行；解析、只读角色、超时、成本预算及结果验证都是独立关卡。\">LLM 生成一个 SELECT 不等于安全。权限应由数据库策略或可信服务执行；解析、只读角色、超时、成本预算及结果验证都是独立关卡。</span></p>\n<h2 class=\"sub\" id=\"data-case\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"11.8 Order-status incidents: deliver reproducible evidence\" data-i18n-zh=\"11.8 订单状态错乱：用可复现的证据交付\">11.8 订单状态错乱：用可复现的证据交付</span></h2>\n<p class=\"rv\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"If an order appears delivered before handoff, audit event times, sequences, duplicates, deletes and canonical state semantics before touching the LLM. Validate reconstructed timelines with labeled historical cases.\" data-i18n-zh=\"客户发现订单在快递交接前显示“已签收”。第一步不是微调 LLM，而是核对来源事件时间、序列、重复、删除和最终状态定义；再用 golden timeline 验证事实还原。\">客户发现订单在快递交接前显示“已签收”。第一步不是微调 LLM，而是核对来源事件时间、序列、重复、删除和最终状态定义；再用 golden timeline 验证事实还原。</span></p>\n<div class=\"tsc rv\"><div aria-label=\"可横向滚动的对比表\" class=\"tw\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Acceptance indicator\" data-i18n-zh=\"验收指标\">验收指标</span></th><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Meaning\" data-i18n-zh=\"意义\">意义</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"CDC lag p95\" data-i18n-zh=\"CDC lag p95\">CDC lag p95</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Delay from source change to query\" data-i18n-zh=\"变更到可查询的延迟\">变更到可查询的延迟</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Duplicate-effect rate\" data-i18n-zh=\"Duplicate-effect rate\">Duplicate-effect rate</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Rate of duplicated business effects\" data-i18n-zh=\"重复消息导致重复业务影响的比例\">重复消息导致重复业务影响的比例</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Reconciliation completeness\" data-i18n-zh=\"Reconciliation completeness\">Reconciliation completeness</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Source and target totals reconcile\" data-i18n-zh=\"源系统与目标结果可核对\">源系统与目标结果可核对</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Policy-leak tests\" data-i18n-zh=\"Policy-leak tests\">Policy-leak tests</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Cross-tenant reads are blocked\" data-i18n-zh=\"跨租户请求无法取数\">跨租户请求无法取数</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\n<p class=\"rv\"><a href=\"https://www.fdeinterviews.com/concepts\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Source: FDE curriculum topics (not copied course text) ↗</a></p></section></div>", "en": "<div><section class=\"ch\" id=\"ch11\"><p class=\"lead rv\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Keep production data correct, fresh, traceable and permission-aware. Learn CDC, Lakehouse, SQL, Spark and Text-to-SQL as one delivery discipline.\" data-i18n-zh=\"让数据在生产系统中保持正确、及时、可回溯、有权限边界。理解 CDC、Lakehouse、SQL、Spark 与 Text-to-SQL 的集成决策。\">Keep production data correct, fresh, traceable and permission-aware. Learn CDC, Lakehouse, SQL, Spark and Text-to-SQL as one delivery discipline.</span></p><h2 class=\"sub\" id=\"data-plane\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"11.1 End-to-end data path: source events to trusted AI context\" data-i18n-zh=\"11.1 端到端数据路径：从源事件到可信 AI Context\">11.1 End-to-end data path: source events to trusted AI context</span></h2>\n<p class=\"rv\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"An FDE must inspect the data plane behind RAG: source ownership, freshness, query readiness, replayability, and enforcement of tenant permissions.\" data-i18n-zh=\"FDE 不该只讨论 RAG 检索策略，还要确认：数据是谁提供的、更新有多快、何时可以查询、出了错是否能重放，以及租户权限在哪里执行。\">An FDE must inspect the data plane behind RAG: source ownership, freshness, query readiness, replayability, and enforcement of tenant permissions.</span></p>\n<pre aria-label=\"Code example\" class=\"rv\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><code>Source DB / SaaS / events\n    ↓ CDC / batch extract\nBronze · raw append + offsets\n    ↓ schema / dedup / quarantine\nSilver · verified, versioned entities\n    ↓ contracts / temporal joins\nGold · governed customer views\n    ├── SQL, BI and workflow queries\n    ├── model features\n    └── retrieval indexing → RAG</code></pre>\n<div class=\"tsc rv\"><div aria-label=\"Scrollable comparison table\" class=\"tw\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Boundary\" data-i18n-zh=\"边界\">Boundary</span></th><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Explicit contract\" data-i18n-zh=\"必须明确的约束\">Explicit contract</span></th><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Failure\" data-i18n-zh=\"常见失败\">Failure</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Capture\" data-i18n-zh=\"Capture\">Capture</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Sequence, offset, delete\" data-i18n-zh=\"事件序列、offset、delete\">Sequence, offset, delete</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Missed or duplicate events\" data-i18n-zh=\"漏更或重复\">Missed or duplicate events</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Normalize\" data-i18n-zh=\"Normalize\">Normalize</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Unique key, schema, time zone\" data-i18n-zh=\"唯一键、schema、时区\">Unique key, schema, time zone</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Cross-system mismatch\" data-i18n-zh=\"跨系统错配\">Cross-system mismatch</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Consume\" data-i18n-zh=\"Consume\">Consume</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Freshness, tenancy, lineage\" data-i18n-zh=\"freshness、租户、可追溯\">Freshness, tenancy, lineage</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Stale or unauthorized reads\" data-i18n-zh=\"过期或越权读取\">Stale or unauthorized reads</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\n<aside class=\"co must rv\"><span class=\"co-t\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Engineering rule\" data-i18n-zh=\"工程结论\">Engineering rule</span></span><p><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"A fast agent with incorrect data fails faster. Correctness, freshness, and authorization are independent test dimensions.\" data-i18n-zh=\"实时 Agent + 错误的数据 = 快速出错。数据正确性、及时性与授权是不同的验证维度。\">A fast agent with incorrect data fails faster. Correctness, freshness, and authorization are independent test dimensions.</span></p></aside>\n<h2 class=\"sub\" id=\"data-etl-cdc\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"11.2 ETL / ELT / CDC: choose by data boundary\" data-i18n-zh=\"11.2 ETL / ELT / CDC：选最适合数据边界的路径\">11.2 ETL / ELT / CDC: choose by data boundary</span></h2>\n<div class=\"tsc rv\"><div aria-label=\"Scrollable comparison table\" class=\"tw\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Mechanism\" data-i18n-zh=\"机制\">Mechanism</span></th><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"When useful\" data-i18n-zh=\"适用情况\">When useful</span></th><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Verify\" data-i18n-zh=\"要验证的问题\">Verify</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"ETL\" data-i18n-zh=\"ETL\">ETL</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Transform before governed load\" data-i18n-zh=\"先清洗/限制敏感数据再入库\">Transform before governed load</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Can transforms be replayed?\" data-i18n-zh=\"前置逻辑能否重放？\">Can transforms be replayed?</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"ELT\" data-i18n-zh=\"ELT\">ELT</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Governed raw landing; warehouse transforms\" data-i18n-zh=\"先安全留存原始数据，再在仓内转换\">Governed raw landing; warehouse transforms</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Is raw access isolated?\" data-i18n-zh=\"原始数据访问是否隔离？\">Is raw access isolated?</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"CDC\" data-i18n-zh=\"CDC\">CDC</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Row-level changes and deletes\" data-i18n-zh=\"增量变更与删除传播\">Row-level changes and deletes</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Snapshot, order, offset, tombstone\" data-i18n-zh=\"初始快照、顺序、offset 与 tombstone\">Snapshot, order, offset, tombstone</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\n<p class=\"rv\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Batch versus streaming is driven by the consumer's visibility-lag objective, not by which architecture sounds more advanced.\" data-i18n-zh=\"Batch 与 Streaming 取决于消费者对事件可见延迟的目标，而不是“实时”是否听起来更先进。\">Batch versus streaming is driven by the consumer's visibility-lag objective, not by which architecture sounds more advanced.</span></p>\n<h2 class=\"sub\" id=\"idempotent-pipeline\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"11.3 Idempotency: duplicated events must not duplicate effects\" data-i18n-zh=\"11.3 Idempotency：允许消息重复，不允许业务结果重复\">11.3 Idempotency: duplicated events must not duplicate effects</span></h2>\n<pre aria-label=\"Code example\" class=\"rv\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><code>event(source, event_id, entity, version, operation)\n → durable raw log\n → validate + quarantine\n → dedup(source, event_id)\n → merge if version is newer\n → atomically commit sink and checkpoint</code></pre>\n<p class=\"rv\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"At-least-once delivery is an engineering constraint. Define who owns stable idempotency keys, retries, out-of-order updates, deletes, and cross-system reconciliation.\" data-i18n-zh=\"At-least-once delivery 不是异常，而是工程约束。必须明确谁生成稳定的幂等键、何时重试、如何处理 out-of-order 更新与删除，以及跨系统写入如何补偿。\">At-least-once delivery is an engineering constraint. Define who owns stable idempotency keys, retries, out-of-order updates, deletes, and cross-system reconciliation.</span></p>\n<h2 class=\"sub\" id=\"lakehouse-medallion\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"11.4 Lakehouse / Delta: Bronze, Silver, Gold ownership\" data-i18n-zh=\"11.4 Lakehouse / Delta：Bronze、Silver、Gold 各自负责什么\">11.4 Lakehouse / Delta: Bronze, Silver, Gold ownership</span></h2>\n<div class=\"tsc rv\"><div aria-label=\"Scrollable comparison table\" class=\"tw\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Layer\" data-i18n-zh=\"层\">Layer</span></th><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Responsibility\" data-i18n-zh=\"职责\">Responsibility</span></th><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Not a guarantee of\" data-i18n-zh=\"不可误认为\">Not a guarantee of</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Bronze\" data-i18n-zh=\"Bronze\">Bronze</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Replayable raw data and provenance\" data-i18n-zh=\"可重放原始数据、provenance\">Replayable raw data and provenance</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Raw data is trustworthy\" data-i18n-zh=\"原始数据可信\">Raw data is trustworthy</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Silver\" data-i18n-zh=\"Silver\">Silver</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Validated, deduplicated, upserted entities\" data-i18n-zh=\"校验、去重、更新、实体标准化\">Validated, deduplicated, upserted entities</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Business meaning is agreed\" data-i18n-zh=\"业务含义已经统一\">Business meaning is agreed</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Gold\" data-i18n-zh=\"Gold\">Gold</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Consumer contracts and business views\" data-i18n-zh=\"业务契约与消费者视图\">Consumer contracts and business views</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Cross-system atomicity\" data-i18n-zh=\"自动解决跨系统事务\">Cross-system atomicity</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\n<p class=\"rv\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"A Delta transaction log gives table-level snapshot and atomic-commit behavior; it does not guarantee exactly-once business effects across HTTP, queues, and other databases.\" data-i18n-zh=\"Delta transaction log 提供表层面的快照和原子提交；它本身不能保证 HTTP、消息队列、其他数据库之间的 exactly-once 业务效果。\">A Delta transaction log gives table-level snapshot and atomic-commit behavior; it does not guarantee exactly-once business effects across HTTP, queues, and other databases.</span></p>\n<h2 class=\"sub\" id=\"sql-history\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"11.5 SQL windows and SCD2: preserve temporal truth\" data-i18n-zh=\"11.5 SQL Window 与 SCD2：保留时序真实性\">11.5 SQL windows and SCD2: preserve temporal truth</span></h2>\n<pre aria-label=\"Code example\" class=\"rv\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><code>WITH ranked AS (\n  SELECT *, ROW_NUMBER() OVER (\n    PARTITION BY tenant_id, entity_id\n    ORDER BY source_version DESC, ingested_at DESC\n  ) AS rn\n  FROM normalized_events\n)\nSELECT * FROM ranked WHERE rn = 1;</code></pre>\n<p class=\"rv\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Latest-record queries need version precedence, tie breaking and delete semantics. SCD Type 2 preserves effective-time intervals; point-in-time joins prevent training-time future leakage.\" data-i18n-zh=\"最新记录查询必须定义版本比较、并列消解、删除语义。SCD Type 2 使用 effective_from / effective_to 维护历史快照；point-in-time join 避免训练时偷看未来。\">Latest-record queries need version precedence, tie breaking and delete semantics. SCD Type 2 preserves effective-time intervals; point-in-time joins prevent training-time future leakage.</span></p>\n<h2 class=\"sub\" id=\"spark-diagnostics\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"11.6 Spark / streaming: inspect the plan and state boundaries\" data-i18n-zh=\"11.6 Spark / Streaming：先看执行计划与状态边界\">11.6 Spark / streaming: inspect the plan and state boundaries</span></h2>\n<div class=\"tsc rv\"><div aria-label=\"Scrollable comparison table\" class=\"tw\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Symptom\" data-i18n-zh=\"症状\">Symptom</span></th><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Inspect\" data-i18n-zh=\"排查入口\">Inspect</span></th><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Trade-off\" data-i18n-zh=\"权衡\">Trade-off</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Slow join\" data-i18n-zh=\"Join 很慢\">Slow join</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Explain, shuffle bytes, skew\" data-i18n-zh=\"Explain、shuffle bytes、skew\">Explain, shuffle bytes, skew</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Broadcast small tables; oversized joins risk OOM\" data-i18n-zh=\"Broadcast 对小表有效，过大会 OOM\">Broadcast small tables; oversized joins risk OOM</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Long-tail tasks\" data-i18n-zh=\"任务尾部很长\">Long-tail tasks</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Task skew, spill, file count\" data-i18n-zh=\"Task skew、spill、文件数\">Task skew, spill, file count</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"More partitions are not always better\" data-i18n-zh=\"分区数量不是越多越好\">More partitions are not always better</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Growing stream state\" data-i18n-zh=\"Streaming state 变大\">Growing stream state</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Event-time, watermark, checkpoint\" data-i18n-zh=\"Event-time、watermark、checkpoint\">Event-time, watermark, checkpoint</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Late-data policy versus completeness\" data-i18n-zh=\"迟到数据策略与完整性权衡\">Late-data policy versus completeness</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\n<h2 class=\"sub\" id=\"safe-text-to-sql\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"11.7 Text-to-SQL: executable does not mean authorized\" data-i18n-zh=\"11.7 Text-to-SQL：能执行 ≠ 有权限\">11.7 Text-to-SQL: executable does not mean authorized</span></h2>\n<pre aria-label=\"Code example\" class=\"rv\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><code>User intent\n → approved semantic schema + identity\n → SQL candidate\n → parse / allowlisted operations\n → database RLS / scoped credentials\n → EXPLAIN / row and time budget\n → run / verify / return source freshness</code></pre>\n<p class=\"rv\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"An LLM-generated SELECT is not a safety guarantee. Enforce permissions in the database or a trusted service, with parsing, read-only roles, budgets and result verification as separate gates.\" data-i18n-zh=\"LLM 生成一个 SELECT 不等于安全。权限应由数据库策略或可信服务执行；解析、只读角色、超时、成本预算及结果验证都是独立关卡。\">An LLM-generated SELECT is not a safety guarantee. Enforce permissions in the database or a trusted service, with parsing, read-only roles, budgets and result verification as separate gates.</span></p>\n<h2 class=\"sub\" id=\"data-case\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"11.8 Order-status incidents: deliver reproducible evidence\" data-i18n-zh=\"11.8 订单状态错乱：用可复现的证据交付\">11.8 Order-status incidents: deliver reproducible evidence</span></h2>\n<p class=\"rv\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"If an order appears delivered before handoff, audit event times, sequences, duplicates, deletes and canonical state semantics before touching the LLM. Validate reconstructed timelines with labeled historical cases.\" data-i18n-zh=\"客户发现订单在快递交接前显示“已签收”。第一步不是微调 LLM，而是核对来源事件时间、序列、重复、删除和最终状态定义；再用 golden timeline 验证事实还原。\">If an order appears delivered before handoff, audit event times, sequences, duplicates, deletes and canonical state semantics before touching the LLM. Validate reconstructed timelines with labeled historical cases.</span></p>\n<div class=\"tsc rv\"><div aria-label=\"Scrollable comparison table\" class=\"tw\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Acceptance indicator\" data-i18n-zh=\"验收指标\">Acceptance indicator</span></th><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Meaning\" data-i18n-zh=\"意义\">Meaning</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"CDC lag p95\" data-i18n-zh=\"CDC lag p95\">CDC lag p95</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Delay from source change to query\" data-i18n-zh=\"变更到可查询的延迟\">Delay from source change to query</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Duplicate-effect rate\" data-i18n-zh=\"Duplicate-effect rate\">Duplicate-effect rate</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Rate of duplicated business effects\" data-i18n-zh=\"重复消息导致重复业务影响的比例\">Rate of duplicated business effects</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Reconciliation completeness\" data-i18n-zh=\"Reconciliation completeness\">Reconciliation completeness</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Source and target totals reconcile\" data-i18n-zh=\"源系统与目标结果可核对\">Source and target totals reconcile</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Policy-leak tests\" data-i18n-zh=\"Policy-leak tests\">Policy-leak tests</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Cross-tenant reads are blocked\" data-i18n-zh=\"跨租户请求无法取数\">Cross-tenant reads are blocked</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\n<p class=\"rv\"><a href=\"https://www.fdeinterviews.com/concepts\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Source: FDE curriculum topics (not copied course text) ↗</a></p></section></div>", "sections": [{"id": "data-plane", "zh": "11.1 端到端数据路径：从源事件到可信 AI Context", "en": "11.1 End-to-end data path: source events to trusted AI context"}, {"id": "data-etl-cdc", "zh": "11.2 ETL / ELT / CDC：选最适合数据边界的路径", "en": "11.2 ETL / ELT / CDC: choose by data boundary"}, {"id": "idempotent-pipeline", "zh": "11.3 Idempotency：允许消息重复，不允许业务结果重复", "en": "11.3 Idempotency: duplicated events must not duplicate effects"}, {"id": "lakehouse-medallion", "zh": "11.4 Lakehouse / Delta：Bronze、Silver、Gold 各自负责什么", "en": "11.4 Lakehouse / Delta: Bronze, Silver, Gold ownership"}, {"id": "sql-history", "zh": "11.5 SQL Window 与 SCD2：保留时序真实性", "en": "11.5 SQL windows and SCD2: preserve temporal truth"}, {"id": "spark-diagnostics", "zh": "11.6 Spark / Streaming：先看执行计划与状态边界", "en": "11.6 Spark / streaming: inspect the plan and state boundaries"}, {"id": "safe-text-to-sql", "zh": "11.7 Text-to-SQL：能执行 ≠ 有权限", "en": "11.7 Text-to-SQL: executable does not mean authorized"}, {"id": "data-case", "zh": "11.8 订单状态错乱：用可复现的证据交付", "en": "11.8 Order-status incidents: deliver reproducible evidence"}], "supplements": []}